#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Tags </strong>can be used to categorize your products: a clothing "
"item can be part of both the\n"
"            summer collection, the discounts section, and the accessories "
"section, for example."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແທັກ </strong>ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດໝວດໝູ່ສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໄດ້: ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງໜຶ່ງຊິ້ນສາມາດເປັ"
"ນໄດ້ທັງສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ\n"
"            ຄໍເລັກຊັນລະດູຮ້ອນ, ໝວດຫຼຸດລາຄາ, ແລະ ໝວດເຄື່ອງປະດັບຕົກແຕ່ງ."

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:clothing_boutique.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Use automatic reordering rules:</strong> to keep stock levels where "
"they should be"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ນໍາໃຊ້ກົດລະບຽບການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</strong> ເພື່ອຮັກສາລະດັບສະຕັອກໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນເກນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ"
"ຢູ່ສະເໝີ"

